message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "C28 hyperdiamond: a dynamical-stability screening with a machine-learned interatomic potential"
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "davinainebyona"
    website: "https://github.com/davinainebyona"
repository-code: "https://github.com/davinainebyona/c28-hyperdiamond-stability"
date-released: 2026-11-12
version: "0.1.0"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - hyperdiamond
  - C28
  - fullerene
  - phonons
  - dynamical stability
  - machine-learned interatomic potential
abstract: >-
  Screening-level test of the dynamical stability of C28 hyperdiamond, a hypothetical
  carbon crystal proposed in 1992. Using the MACE-MP-0 potential at three model sizes,
  the structure keeps Fd-3m symmetry after full relaxation and shows no imaginary phonon
  modes. This is not a DFT result; limits are stated in the README.
